[{"id":"act:act-about:Formula:0","ch":"act-about","chEn":"Test format & strategy","chAr":"نظام اختبار ACT واستراتيجيات الحل السريع","tag":"Formula","f":"Choices","f_ar":"Choices (نظام اختبار ACT واستراتيجيات الحل السريع)","b":"4 per question","b_ar":"4 per question (نظام اختبار ACT واستراتيجيات الحل السريع)"},{"id":"act:act-about:Theorem:1","ch":"act-about","chEn":"Test format & strategy","chAr":"نظام اختبار ACT واستراتيجيات الحل السريع","tag":"Theorem","f":"Three tactics that score","f_ar":"Three tactics that score","b":"Don't linger — flag a hard item and move on so easy points aren't lost. <strong>Backsolve</strong> from the answer choices, and <strong>plug in</strong> convenient numbers for variables when a question is abstract.","b_ar":"Don't linger — flag a hard item and move on so easy points aren't lost. <strong>Backsolve</strong> from the answer choices, and <strong>plug in</strong> convenient numbers for variables when a question is abstract."},{"id":"act:act-coordgeo:Formula:2","ch":"act-coordgeo","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Slope Formula","f_ar":"الميل الصيغة","b":"\\( m = \\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\)","b_ar":"\\( m = \\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-coordgeo:Formula:3","ch":"act-coordgeo","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Distance Formula","f_ar":"Distance الصيغة","b":"\\( d = \\sqrt{\\Delta x^{2}+\\Delta y^{2}} \\)","b_ar":"\\( d = \\sqrt{\\Delta x^{2}+\\Delta y^{2}} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-coordgeo:Formula:4","ch":"act-coordgeo","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Midpoint Formula","f_ar":"Midpoint الصيغة","b":"\\( M = \\left(\\tfrac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\,\\tfrac{y_1+y_2}{2}\\right) \\)","b_ar":"\\( M = \\left(\\tfrac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\,\\tfrac{y_1+y_2}{2}\\right) \\)"},{"id":"act:act-coordgeo:Formula:5","ch":"act-coordgeo","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Circle Equation","f_ar":"الدائرة المعادلة","b":"\\( (x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2 \\)","b_ar":"\\( (x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2 \\)"},{"id":"act:act-planegeo:Formula:6","ch":"act-planegeo","chEn":"Plane Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية والأشكال الهندسية","tag":"Formula","f":"Trapezoid Area","f_ar":"Trapezoid المساحة","b":"\\( A = \\frac{b_1 + b_2}{2} \\cdot h \\)","b_ar":"\\( A = \\frac{b_1 + b_2}{2} \\cdot h \\)"},{"id":"act:act-planegeo:Formula:7","ch":"act-planegeo","chEn":"Plane Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية والأشكال الهندسية","tag":"Formula","f":"Circle Sector Area","f_ar":"الدائرة Sector المساحة","b":"\\( A_{\\text{sec}} = \\frac{\\theta}{360^\\circ}\\pi r^2 \\)","b_ar":"\\( A_{\\text{sec}} = \\frac{\\theta}{360^\\circ}\\pi r^2 \\)"},{"id":"act:act-planegeo:Formula:8","ch":"act-planegeo","chEn":"Plane Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية والأشكال الهندسية","tag":"Formula","f":"Cylinder Volume","f_ar":"Cylinder الحجم","b":"\\( V = \\pi r^2 h \\)","b_ar":"\\( V = \\pi r^2 h \\)"},{"id":"act:act-planegeo:Formula:9","ch":"act-planegeo","chEn":"Plane Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية والأشكال الهندسية","tag":"Formula","f":"Sphere Volume","f_ar":"Sphere الحجم","b":"\\( V = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3 \\)","b_ar":"\\( V = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3 \\)"},{"id":"act:act-trig:Formula:10","ch":"act-trig","chEn":"Trigonometry","chAr":"حساب المثلثات والدوال المثلثية","tag":"Formula","f":"Secant","f_ar":"Secant (حساب المثلثات والدوال المثلثية)","b":"\\( \\sec\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\sec\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-trig:Formula:11","ch":"act-trig","chEn":"Trigonometry","chAr":"حساب المثلثات والدوال المثلثية","tag":"Formula","f":"Cosecant","f_ar":"Cosecant (حساب المثلثات والدوال المثلثية)","b":"\\( \\csc\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\csc\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-trig:Formula:12","ch":"act-trig","chEn":"Trigonometry","chAr":"حساب المثلثات والدوال المثلثية","tag":"Formula","f":"Pythagorean Identity","f_ar":"Pythagorean المتطابقة","b":"\\( \\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1 \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1 \\)"},{"id":"act:act-trig:Formula:13","ch":"act-trig","chEn":"Trigonometry","chAr":"حساب المثلثات والدوال المثلثية","tag":"Formula","f":"Period Formula","f_ar":"Period الصيغة","b":"\\( T = \\frac{2\\pi}{B} \\)","b_ar":"\\( T = \\frac{2\\pi}{B} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-stats:Formula:14","ch":"act-stats","chEn":"Statistics & Probability","chAr":"الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات","tag":"Formula","f":"Weighted Average","f_ar":"Weighted Average (الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات)","b":"\\( \\frac{\\sum w_i x_i}{\\sum w_i} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\frac{\\sum w_i x_i}{\\sum w_i} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-stats:Formula:15","ch":"act-stats","chEn":"Statistics & Probability","chAr":"الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات","tag":"Formula","f":"Expected Value","f_ar":"Expected Value (الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات)","b":"\\( E(X) = \\sum x_i P(x_i) \\)","b_ar":"\\( E(X) = \\sum x_i P(x_i) \\)"},{"id":"act:act-stats:Formula:16","ch":"act-stats","chEn":"Statistics & Probability","chAr":"الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات","tag":"Formula","f":"Combination","f_ar":"Combination (الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات)","b":"\\( \\binom{n}{r} = \\frac{n!}{r!(n-r)!} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\binom{n}{r} = \\frac{n!}{r!(n-r)!} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-stats:Formula:17","ch":"act-stats","chEn":"Statistics & Probability","chAr":"الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات","tag":"Formula","f":"Permutation","f_ar":"Permutation (الإحصاء والاحتمالات وتحليل البيانات)","b":"\\( {}_n P_r = \\frac{n!}{(n-r)!} \\)","b_ar":"\\( {}_n P_r = \\frac{n!}{(n-r)!} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-advanced:Definition:18","ch":"act-advanced","chEn":"Matrices, Vectors & Complex Numbers","chAr":"المصفوفات والمتجهات والأعداد المركبة","tag":"Definition","f":"Deep Conceptual Intuition — Matrices, Vectors & Complex Numbers","f_ar":"الحدس المفاهيمي العميق — المصفوفات, المتجهات & Complex Numbers","b":"<p><strong>Algebraic &amp; Geometric Duality of \\(\\mathbb{C}\\):</strong> Every complex number \\(z = x + iy\\) corresponds bijectively to a point \\((x, y)\\) in the Argand plane with modulus \\(r = |z| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}\\) and principal argument \\(\\theta = \\arg(z) \\in (-\\pi, \\pi]\\). In exponential Euler form, \\(z = re^{i\\theta} = r(\\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta)\\), multiplication scales moduli and adds arguments: \\(z_1 z_2 = r_1 r_2 e^{i(\\theta_1 + \\theta_2)}\\).</p>","b_ar":"<p><strong>Algebraic &amp; Geometric Duality of \\(\\mathbb{C}\\):</strong> Every complex number \\(z = x + iy\\) corresponds bijectively to a point \\((x, y)\\) in the Argand plane with modulus \\(r = |z| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}\\) and principal argument \\(\\theta = \\arg(z) \\in (-\\pi, \\pi]\\). In exponential Euler form, \\(z = re^{i\\theta} = r(\\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta)\\), multiplication scales moduli and adds arguments: \\(z_1 z_2 = r_1 r_2 e^{i(\\theta_1 + \\theta_2)}\\).</p>"},{"id":"act:act-advanced:Formula:19","ch":"act-advanced","chEn":"Matrices, Vectors & Complex Numbers","chAr":"المصفوفات والمتجهات والأعداد المركبة","tag":"Formula","f":"Powers of i","f_ar":"Powers of i (المصفوفات والمتجهات والأعداد المركبة)","b":"\\( i^2 = -1, \\; i^4 = 1 \\)","b_ar":"\\( i^2 = -1, \\; i^4 = 1 \\)"},{"id":"act:act-advanced:Formula:20","ch":"act-advanced","chEn":"Matrices, Vectors & Complex Numbers","chAr":"المصفوفات والمتجهات والأعداد المركبة","tag":"Formula","f":"2x2 Determinant","f_ar":"2x2 المحدد","b":"\\( \\det = ad - bc \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\det = ad - bc \\)"},{"id":"act:act-advanced:Formula:21","ch":"act-advanced","chEn":"Matrices, Vectors & Complex Numbers","chAr":"المصفوفات والمتجهات والأعداد المركبة","tag":"Formula","f":"Vector Magnitude","f_ar":"المتجه Magnitude","b":"\\( \\|\\vec{v}\\| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\|\\vec{v}\\| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} \\)"},{"id":"act:act-advanced:Formula:22","ch":"act-advanced","chEn":"Matrices, Vectors & Complex Numbers","chAr":"المصفوفات والمتجهات والأعداد المركبة","tag":"Formula","f":"Infinite Geometric Sum","f_ar":"Infinite Geometric Sum (المصفوفات والمتجهات والأعداد المركبة)","b":"\\( S_\\infty = \\frac{a_1}{1 - r} \\)","b_ar":"\\( S_\\infty = \\frac{a_1}{1 - r} \\)"}]